                      text: '# Robert "Bobby" Jenkins Tulsa, OK bobby.jenkins@email.com\n\n\n## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\n\nDedicated master plumber with 22 years of experience in residential and commercial plumbing. Known for excellent\ncustomer service, reliable project delivery, and strong work ethic. Experienced small business owner with a track\nrecord of building lasting client relationships and managing teams. Seeking new career opportunities to leverage\nleadership and customer-facing skills.\n\n\n## WORK EXPERIENCE\n\nOwner & Master Plumber\n\nJenkins Plumbing Solutions - Tulsa, OK | 2012 - 2025\n\n· Founded and operated a plumbing business with 4 employees, growing annual revenue to $480K\n\n· Managed all aspects of operations: scheduling, client relationships, invoicing, and procurement\n\n· Specialized in residential renovations and commercial bathroom installations\n\n· Maintained a 4.9/5 rating on Google Reviews with 200+ satisfied customers\n\n\n### Senior Plumber\n\nTulsa Metro Plumbing Co. - Tulsa, OK | 2006 - 2012\n\n· Led a team of 3 journeyman plumbers on commercial plumbing projects\n\n· Handled estimates and client consultations for projects valued up to $50K\n\n· Trained and mentored 2 apprentice plumbers through their certification programs\n\n\n### Apprentice to Journeyman Plumber\n\nRotoRooter Franchise - Broken Arrow, OK | 2003 - 2006\n\n· Completed apprenticeship program and earned journeyman certification\n\n· Performed emergency service calls, drain cleaning, and water heater installations\n\n· Recognized as Employee of the Quarter twice for outstanding customer service\n\n\n## EDUCATION\n\nPlumbing Technology Certificate - Tulsa Technology Center, 2003\nHigh School Diploma - Broken Arrow High School, 2001\n\n\n## CERTIFICATIONS\n\n· Oklahoma Master Plumber License . OSHA 30-Hour Construction Safety\n\n· Backflow Prevention Certification . EPA Section 608 Certification\n\n\n## SKILLS\n\nPipe Fitting | Soldering | Blueprint Reading | Customer Service | Project Estimation | Team Supervision\nQuickBooks | Basic Excel\n',
